If this repository remains public, applicable GitHub terms permit platform viewing and forking. This notice does not override those permissions. Rights and exceptions that applicable law makes nonwaivable are preserved. Any separate written agreement governs the express additional permissions it lawfully grants; no such agreement is created by this draft.

