Qualifying human contributions may be protected independently of underlying AI-generated or third-party material. Provider permission to use an output is distinct from copyrightability and does not guarantee uniqueness or clear third-party rights. This notice is not a copyright registration, trademark registration or representation that any particular asset has been legally cleared.

